            "review_text": "Hoan N\n143 contributions\n0\nOne of the best Pizzas in Vietnam\nMar 2021 • Friends\nThey really have good Pizzas but also couple of signatures dishes.\n\nTrue and agree with the comment of the other customer living at Estella Heights and rating them 1, that sometimes service quality is not always regular or equal across the several branch.\nAlso hope they are working on it.\n\nI havent experienced yet very bad service, while being pretty picky myself, but if it happens to me, will post again.\n\nNot easy to build and develop a consistent quality food or restaurant franchise/chain, so keep up with the good work!\n\n)\nRead more\nWritten February 4, 2022\nPizza 4P's\nDear Mr/Ms Kho_Tinh_Food_Lover\n\nWe are really happy that you enjoyed your experience in Pizza 4P's and your feedback means everything to us. As we are always looking for ways to deliver WOW and happiness to our customers every day, your support is a valuable part of that process. We hope to have a chance to welcome you back next time.\n\nHave a great day.\n\nPizza 4P's Team.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
