            "review_text": "Balza G\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam33 contributions\n0\nStill don t inderstand to bring fist playe before the second\nJan 2021 • Couples\nOrdered tomato mozarella as first and after pizza and pasta. The staff brought all the food together. Seems like we are in a local Vietnamese restaurant..... staff don t understand....\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2021\nPizza 4P's\nDear Mr./Ms. Balza Guy,\n\nThank you for dining at Pizza 4P's and leaving us valuable feedback. We are truly sorry that our restaurant's service did not make you satisfied as to your expectation. We sincerely thank you for bringing this issue to our attention. We are always looking for ways to deliver WOW and happiness to our customers every day, and your feedback is an invaluable part of that process.\nWe look forward to serving you again. Thank you\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
